                <pb facs="0620" n="586" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg586"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in No. 1267.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to United States Consul at
                        Alexandretta.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-04-26"><hi rendition="#italic">April 26,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Assist with your good office Stamford Manufacturing Company in retaining their
                    agents until they can get others.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
